  m_Name: Cap3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  partName: Cap3
  description: The Cap4 is a tiny, compact component located at the middle-center-center
    of the jet engine, made of Shaft1 material, serving as a protective covering
    for the engine's shaft. Its primary function is to prevent damage from debris
    and ensure the shaft's integrity, thereby maintaining engine reliability. Interestingly,
    the Cap4 is designed to be highly durable, withstanding the harsh conditions
    and extreme temperatures encountered during engine operation.
  audioExplanation: {fileID: 0}
